       →  6. Exec sign-off  →  7. JIRA Query Checker  →  8. Fix issues
       →  8.5. Doc sign-off  →  8.6. Final Acceptance (QA owns UX)  →  9. Security (PAUSED)  →  10. Merge  →  11. Back to user
