```

Multi-model review (**`/multi-model-review`**, pack skill
`agent-pack/skills/multi-model-review/`) **strengthens stage 2** — it does **not**
replace this stage order. Taking in its goodness means: parallel independent
model reviewers, model-selection neutrality, consensus vs lone-model synthesis,
and no auto-fix. Stages 3–8 still run when they apply (stage 9 Security is paused, stage 10 Merge runs after KPIs MET). SoT is the pack (D38);
